0230","text":"Precursor of neuropeptides that bind to all somatostatin receptor (SSTR) subtypes (PubMed:9125122). Inhibits cAMP production induced by forskolin through SSTRs (PubMed:9125122). [Cortistatin-14]: Neuropeptide with neuronal depressant and sleep-modulating properties (By similarity). Acts as a ligand for MRGPRX2 receptor in mast cells (PubMed:12915402, PubMed:34789874, PubMed:34789875)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}